# graphify — share the prebuilt knowledge graph with the team.
# Commit the three portable artifacts below; ignore everything else in
# graphify-out/ (local cost tracker, regenerable cache/, machine-specific
# interpreter+root dotfiles, and manifest.json which still embeds absolute
# paths in this version and would force teammates into a full rebuild).
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/graph.html
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
.graphify/
